"So the app works correctly regardless of country: the currency is shown "
"everywhere (invoices, quotes, POS), and the calling code automatically "
"completes WhatsApp numbers entered without a country code (e.g. <code>07 12 "
"34 56 78</code> → <code>+225 07 12 34 56 78</code>)."

